          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Related categories</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment.html\">Medical and surgical equipment</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/stretchers.html\">Stretchers and transport chairs</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/stretchers/procedural-stretchers.html\">Procedural stretchers</a></p>\n",
